{"id":"b31a642a9ecd8d64","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure.md","title":"ZFC Rudimentary Closure","display":"df-zfc-rudimentary-closure — ZFC Rudimentary Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure","58-df-zfc-inner4-rudimentary-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-rudimentary-closure — ZFC Rudimentary Closure","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure</span><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-rudimentary-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rudimentary-closure — ZFC Rudimentary Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cbf54d50c77440e3\" href=\"?note=cbf54d50c77440e3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,A,X,Y\\in V\">\\(H,A,X,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cbf54d50c77440e3\" href=\"?note=cbf54d50c77440e3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcInner4RudimentaryClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcInner4RudimentaryClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(H,A) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land \\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(H)\\land \\forall K\\;(A\\subseteq K\\land \\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(K)\\to H\\subseteq K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(H,A) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land \\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(H)\\land \\forall K\\;(A\\subseteq K\\land \\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(K)\\to H\\subseteq K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}closure\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4RudimentaryClosure}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(Y,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}closure\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4RudimentaryClosure}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(Y,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure is characterized by minimality among rud-closed supersets; the inner4 name is an exact argument-reversing alias.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"cbf54d50c77440e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"cbf54d50c77440e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,A,X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcInner4RudimentaryClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(H,A) \\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land \\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(H)\\land \\forall K\\;(A\\subseteq K\\land \\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(K)\\to H\\subseteq K)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}closure\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4RudimentaryClosure}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S(Y,X)","display":true}],"bytes":1151,"backlinks":[{"id":"10c90675676572c7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudimentaryClosure}_S$ (rudimentary-closure predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3332","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure.md|58-df-zfc-rudimentary-closure]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["cbf54d50c77440e3"]}